{"id": "EUVD-2026-97637", "enisaUuid": "3a1d63c2-cfd5-3175-bcaf-340e2c473a19", "description": "SurrealDB from 3.0.0 before 3.3.0 contains an information disclosure vulnerability that allows record users to read values hidden by field-level SELECT permissions through COMPUTED fields. Attackers can select records whose readable COMPUTED fields derive from hidden fields, or use write RETURN clauses with $before/$after to expose hidden values.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:05:23", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T18:14:55", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/surrealdb/surrealdb/security/advisories/GHSA-2jj6-v2fq-rwpp", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/surrealdb-3.0.0-before-3.3.0-information-disclosure-via-computed-fields"], "aliases": ["GHSA-v47r-rv5v-pjrj", "CVE-2026-109335"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.3, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ffcc1566-33c2-301f-8863-38b54e770796", "product": {"name": "surrealdb", "vendor": {"name": "surrealdb"}}, "product_version": "3.0.0 <3.3.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ce2f3b2b-83cf-31a8-8a72-86a20d34ad3f", "vendor": {"name": "surrealdb"}}], "isExploited": false}